<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -- Union Carbide lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -- Union Carbide lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it lowered its recommendation on Union Carbide Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
